            <div xml:id="d1372">

                <pb facs="0915" n="799" xml:id="pg799"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/212.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Spanish Ambassador.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 8, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: Referring to the
                    Department’s note of yesterday regarding the expulsion of Spanish subjects from
                    Torreon, Mexico, I beg to inform you that the Department is in receipt of a
                    telegram from its representative at El Paso, Texas, stating [résumé of telegram
                    from Special Agent Carothers, dated April 7, 1914].</p>
                <p>Immediately upon receipt of the above message, the Department, late yesterday,
                    despatched a telegram to its representative at El Paso, in which he was
                    instructed [resume of telegram to Special Agent Carothers dated April 7,
                    1914].</p>
                <p>The Department will be glad to keep you informed of whatever additional
                    information is received from its representative in regard to this matter.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
